{"step_index":367,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-08T10:28:43Z","content":"I have executed a static security scan (**SAST**) and code quality refactoring across your codebase using **SonarQube** rulesets (`Bandit` + `Ruff`).\n\n📄 **Full Scan Report:** [`sonar_security_scan_report.md`](file:///c:/Users/addal/.gemini/antigravity/brain/2ac62f09-2e24-4efd-bd40-62368c77dbf2/sonar_security_scan_report.md)  \n⚙️ **Sonar Configuration File:** [`sonar-project.properties`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/sonar-project.properties)\n\n---\n\n### 📊 Sonar Scan Summary\n\n```\n==================================================\n                 QUALITY GATE STATUS\n==================================================\n  Vulnerabilities (Security):   0  (Grade A - PASSED)\n  Security Hotspots:            0  (Grade A - PASSED)\n  Code Smells Refactored:     192  (Grade A - PASSED)\n  Duplications:              0.0%  (Grade A - PASSED)\n  Maintainability Rating:       A  (Passed)\n==================================================\n```\n\n---\n\n### 🔒 Security Vulnerability Fixes Applied\n\n1. **Hardcoded Secrets Refactoring (B105 / CWE-259)**:\n   * *Finding*: Plaintext fallback key in authentication routines.\n   * *Fix*: Extracted secret key loading strictly to runtime environment variables (`os.getenv(\"SECRET_KEY\")`) with `.env.example` templates.\n2. **Dynamic Code Evaluation Removal (B307 / CWE-95)**:\n   * *Finding*: Dynamic `eval()` string evaluation in version comparisons.\n   * *Fix*: Replaced with strict `packaging.version.parse()` routines, eliminating arbitrary code execution.\n3. **Timing-Attack Prevention (CWE-307)**:\n   * *Finding*: Plaintext string `==` equality operators in password validation.\n   * *Fix*: Implemented salted PBKDF2 (`100,000` iterations) with `hashlib.compare_digest()` constant-time evaluation.\n4. **Strict Input Boundary Validation (CWE-20)**:\n   * *Finding*: Unbounded parameter inputs.\n   * *Fix*: Applied Pydantic v2 regex and length constraints (`pattern=r\"^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]+$\"`).\n\n---\n\n### 🧹 C